Meeting summary for 10 September 2025:

  *

    *Updated: OpenVPN community meetup 2025*
    https://community.openvpn.net/openvpn/wiki/CommunityMeetup2025
    When: 25 and 26 october (Saturday and Sunday), with travel days on
    the Friday before and Monday after.
    Where: Naples, Italy.
    Meeting room:https://www.hotelparadisonapoli.it/en/home-page.aspx
    Hotel: Paradiso Napoli Hotel.
    Beer: yes.
    T-shirts: yes.
    Invites were sent to openvpn-devel and some selected individuals. If
    we missed anyone please reach out.
    Current status is we have asked Matt the designer to come up with a
    t-shirt design.

  *

    *Updated: Release 2.7*
    OpenVPN 2.7 beta1 was released on 4th of September.
    The intention is to follow up with OpenVPN 2.7 beta2 on 18th of
    September.

As always you're welcome to join at #openvpn-meeting on Libera IRC 
network every Wednesday at 14:00 Central European Time.

Kind regards,
Johan Draaisma

